Everything under this directory comes from the Maddison Project Database
(MPD), releases 2018, 2020 and 2023, published by the Groningen Growth and
Development Centre (GGDC), University of Groningen, at
https://www.rug.nl/ggdc/historicaldevelopment/maddison/ (the 2023 files on
DataverseNL, https://doi.org/10.34894/INZBF2).

Each release page, read on 2026-10-05, says that the release "is licensed
under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License": version
2018 by Jutta Bolt, Robert Inklaar, Herman de Jong and Jan Luiten van
Zanden; versions 2020 and 2023 by Jutta Bolt and Jan Luiten van Zanden.
DataverseNL gives the 2023 dataset the licence CC-BY-4.0.

The 2020 and 2023 pages ask that all original papers be cited when the data
is shown in any graphical form, or when a subset of fewer than a dozen (12)
countries is used for statistical analysis or any other purpose; the list
of original papers is in the Sources sheet of the database. For 2018 the
references to the original research are in Appendix A of Bolt et al.
(2018). Otherwise the MPD as a whole is to be cited. The citation of each
release is in README.md beside this file.

The files under raw/<release>/ are GGDC's own xlsx, dta and pdf files, byte
for byte; each release's MANIFEST.json records their URLs, sizes, sha256
and Last-Modified.

The Parquet under parquet/<release>/ was made from six sheets of the xlsx
files (2018: Full data, the regional Long data and Composition, the 1990
benchmark LongForm; 2020 and 2023: Full data):

  - each cell was read as its text and typed by the column's name: year as
    an integer; gdppc, cgdppc, rgdpnapc and pop as floats; every other
    column is the text of the cell
  - rows with no value in any column were left out (126 formatted but empty
    rows at the foot of the 2018 Full data sheet)
  - no value was changed, and the rows keep the order of the sheet

The dta files were not read or converted.

The code that fetches, checks and converts lives in the repository this
dataset was built from, is not part of this dataset, and is not covered by
this licence.
